    retryable, details? (JSON string when non-empty), source?} from the same EngineError fields
    (was `format!("[{}] {}", error.code, error.message)`).
IDE (extensions/quantlab/src/quantbook/types.ts):
  - New `interface OperationErrorJson { code; class; retryable; details?; source? }`.
  - OperationStateJson.error retyped `string` → `OperationErrorJson`.
  - NO session.ts consumer change needed: `grep` confirms OperationStateJson is referenced ONLY in
    types.ts (its def + EventJson.state?); no code reads `.error` as a string.

